01:15:45.662 --> 01:15:48.856
Diane, honestly, I'm not having an affair.
I'm not. I swear.

944
01:15:48.881 --> 01:15:50.997
Ok?
I'm just crazy.

945
01:16:00.880 --> 01:16:02.411
Amazing!!

946
01:16:02.427 --> 01:16:04.872
That's probably the greatest game
of pool ever played.

947
01:16:05.662 --> 01:16:08.388
- Hi, Dylan.
- Oh, hi. Queen of the rodeo!

948
01:16:08.818 --> 01:16:11.959
Rodeo queen huh? What, you came to
watch me making pool history?

949
01:16:15.514 --> 01:16:18.068
- Had a few pitchers, haven't you?
- You know my only regret?

950
01:16:18.319 --> 01:16:21.361
It's that I gave up my law practice
to become a show girl.

951
01:16:22.276 --> 01:16:25.400
- Can I pour myself one?
- Yeah, yeah. Yeah, yeah.

952
01:16:25.604 --> 01:16:27.837
Hey, hey, hey.
Have a .. have a beer.

953
01:16:31.634 --> 01:16:33.355
Who's gonna find his ball?

954
01:16:34.463 --> 01:16:37.058
So..Wayne said that
Jake gave you the can.

955
01:16:38.020 --> 01:16:40.115
- That blows.
- Hey, Donna, sister.

956
01:16:40.538 --> 01:16:42.538
Where the hell you been
hiding at, Dill Pickle?

957
01:16:42.563 --> 01:16:44.563
Thank god, you come.

958
01:16:46.971 --> 01:16:48.971
Is it time to do crimes?

959
01:16:51.307 --> 01:16:53.307
Yeah, man, we been
waiting on you.

960
01:16:55.480 --> 01:16:57.523
- Cue ball.
- Quite enough dicking around...

961
01:16:57.548 --> 01:17:00.281
- ..are we doing this or not?
- Hell, yes! Let's do it.

962
01:17:00.634 --> 01:17:03.220
- Let's do it.
- Alright, here's the address..

963
01:17:03.393 --> 01:17:05.291
Need you to roll up there.
Check the place out.

964
01:17:05.299 --> 01:17:06.785
We go in Thursday night.

965
01:17:07.324 --> 01:17:09.819
Let's do it now.
Let's do it now!

966
01:17:09.844 --> 01:17:12.409
I mean, what am I waiting for, right?
This is what I do..

967
01:17:12.434 --> 01:17:15.127
I mean, I'm a criminal-element-man
type, man.

968
01:17:15.510 --> 01:17:17.909
Just like you!
Like, who am I kidding?

969
01:17:18.075 --> 01:17:21.955
Maybe you've had enough, Dill.
Maybe you wanna head home, sleep it off.

970
01:17:21.980 --> 01:17:25.533
Oh, no. I want some action!!
I want some action, yes!!

971
01:17:25.558 --> 01:17:27.558
Come on!!
Let's get lost!

972
01:17:28.825 --> 01:17:30.825
Hey, you can be my ma.

973
01:17:30.826 --> 01:17:33.770
Yeah, I mean I got to have a ma.

974
01:17:37.322 --> 01:17:39.666
Y'see, I got this problem though.

975
01:17:40.269 --> 01:17:43.223
It's that Jim needs a cricket,
he's gonna get all upset with me man...

976
01:17:43.248 --> 01:17:45.248
..and I can't go messing
with Jimmy's cricket.

977
01:17:45.273 --> 01:17:49.269
It's losing my hair with Mr Cricket,
excuse me, "Dr Cricket".

978
01:17:50.035 --> 01:17:53.472
Hey, what am I gonna do when she finds out
that I'm just like everybody said..

979
01:17:53.497 --> 01:17:56.354
- What am I gonna do then, Bo?
- You got voices in your head?

980
01:17:56.550 --> 01:17:58.961
- Is that what you're saying?
- You don't believe me? Donna ?

981
01:17:58.986 --> 01:18:02.625
- He does. - Yeah, I have a world
of craziness up here, man.

982
01:18:02.643 --> 01:18:05.698
So you might wanna find somebody
a little more stable to be your riled man.

983
01:18:05.713 --> 01:18:07.392
Maybe I'm not your guy.

984
01:18:07.397 --> 01:18:09.397
I mean burglary is a
pretty tricky piece of business.

985
01:18:09.422 --> 01:18:11.360
- It's time to shut your mouth now.
- You know what?

986
01:18:11.383 --> 01:18:14.226
I'm getting <i>so sick</i>
of everybody telling me what to do.

987
01:18:18.314 --> 01:18:20.624
Oi!!  Step back, Dylan,y'step back!

988
01:18:20.649 --> 01:18:23.405
You two, get the hell out of my bar!

989
01:18:23.430 --> 01:18:26.362
Alright, Wayne, put the gun down.
Ok, Wayne.

990
01:18:26.387 --> 01:18:29.982
- Man, I got a lump on my head the size of
Nebraska. - Ok. Shut up, shut up, Lyle. That's ok.

991
01:18:30.007 --> 01:18:32.341
- Everything's fine. Everything's fine.
