1022
01:21:56.636 --> 01:21:58.636
He probably did.

1023
01:22:01.410 --> 01:22:03.410
Sure wasn't me.

1024
01:22:05.880 --> 01:22:09.182
- So goddamn weak.
- Becky, how can you say that?

1025
01:22:09.527 --> 01:22:14.560
- What you did for me. - Have I made
your life any easier, honestly?

1026
01:22:15.593 --> 01:22:17.593
Yes.

1027
01:22:21.133 --> 01:22:25.451
You know, I can't read your mind, Dylan
but I know when you're lying.

1028
01:22:27.116 --> 01:22:30.016
- Becky, don't do this.
- I can't live like this.

1029
01:22:31.181 --> 01:22:35.546
Dylan...Phillip is my husband.

1030
01:22:37.008 --> 01:22:41.205
I know you don't like him,
but I need to be with him.

1031
01:22:42.230 --> 01:22:45.455
- I need to find him again. - Yeah,
you gotta do what you're told, right?

1032
01:22:45.949 --> 01:22:47.949
- That's not fair.
- Fair?

1033
01:22:48.755 --> 01:22:52.595
I finally, for once in my life,
I can see something....

1034
01:22:53.081 --> 01:22:56.345
..something real,
and then you tell me I gotta give up, so..

1035
01:22:56.721 --> 01:22:58.721
.. how do you call it fair??

1036
01:22:59.394 --> 01:23:01.394
I can't be with you, and I can't...

1037
01:23:03.129 --> 01:23:05.129
..I can't play at this anymore!

1038
01:23:05.825 --> 01:23:08.025
It's not a game.
It's not something that you play.

1039
01:23:08.698 --> 01:23:10.698
What am I supposed to do?

1040
01:23:11.231 --> 01:23:13.231
You are going to be fine.

1041
01:23:14.802 --> 01:23:16.294
God, Dylan...

1042
01:23:19.538 --> 01:23:21.333
You have so much.

1043
01:23:24.195 --> 01:23:25.372
You...

1044
01:23:26.625 --> 01:23:28.458
..you blew me away.

1045
01:23:30.072 --> 01:23:31.911
You know that, you..

1046
01:23:33.080 --> 01:23:34.895
I'm never gonna forget that.

1047
01:23:35.707 --> 01:23:37.473
- Couldn't we just  ...
- No.

1048
01:23:39.466 --> 01:23:41.849
How do you expect me to just
shut you off ?

1049
01:23:45.077 --> 01:23:47.273
Because you love me.

1050
01:25:21.172 --> 01:25:23.172
Me a whiskey, please?

1051
01:25:23.407 --> 01:25:27.118
The thing is... you come in here
and it's always some kind of trouble.

1052
01:25:30.641 --> 01:25:32.634
Is that why you''re here?

1053
01:25:32.862 --> 01:25:36.727
Not 2 nights ago, you were in here
doing your little MMA style tango...

1054
01:25:36.775 --> 01:25:39.266
- ..with soul brothers.
- They showed up. I left.

1055
01:25:39.549 --> 01:25:43.136
- We didn't associate.
- Dylan, this ain't the goddamn drill.

1056
01:25:43.410 --> 01:25:46.475
Ok? You even got yourself fired.
You're hanging out with known felons.

1057
01:25:46.500 --> 01:25:50.248
- And now, Lyle is looking to bust yo ass off all
across the dessert. - Giddons, look, can you...

1058
01:25:50.718 --> 01:25:52.326
NO!!

1059
01:25:55.006 --> 01:25:57.006
NO!
NO!

1060
01:25:57.648 --> 01:25:59.811
- Please stop!
- What's wrong with you?

1061
01:25:59.836 --> 01:26:01.836
Please !

1062
01:26:11.514 --> 01:26:13.514
Dylan!
Dylan!!

1063
01:26:16.015 --> 01:26:19.622
- What the hell's wrong with you,
you bastards? - Bo and Lyle ?

1064
01:26:20.577 --> 01:26:23.270
Y'know what I'm looking at right now,
a cell.

1065
01:26:23.363 --> 01:26:25.401
You tell me what's going on
with them brothers...

1066
01:26:25.506 --> 01:26:27.506
You won't even have to think about that.
I'll take it...

1067
01:26:27.523 --> 01:26:29.720
No, I mean, I'm looking at her right now.
I'm in it !

1068
01:26:29.970 --> 01:26:30.658
What ?

1069
01:26:30.683 --> 01:26:33.611
This is where they put me,
 'cause this is where they see me.

1070
01:26:33.870 --> 01:26:35.870
Wait a minute, so this is when..

1071
01:26:35.895 --> 01:26:39.044
.. you start blaming the whole world
for your crap, is that right?

1072
01:26:39.061 --> 01:26:41.623
No.
No, this is where I stop.

1073
01:26:44.366 --> 01:26:46.366
We ain't finished.

1074
01:26:51.897 --> 01:26:53.897
I want you to get better.

1075
01:26:55.085 --> 01:27:00.294
To stop...
worrying about everything.

1076
01:27:01.116 --> 01:27:03.116
Everything's gonna be fine.

1077
01:27:05.335 --> 01:27:07.335
You just need to be...

1078
01:27:08.906 --> 01:27:11.758
..alone for a while.
No distractions.

1079
01:27:13.118 --> 01:27:16.045
'till you feel ..yourself again.

1080
01:27:28.068 --> 01:27:31.521
Rebecca.
I love you.

1081
01:28:03.054 --> 01:28:04.707
Oh for..

1082
01:28:08.942 --> 01:28:11.079
Now we both got lumps
in our heads.

1083
01:28:12.454 --> 01:28:15.869
It's Thursday!
Time to go to work, Dyl !

1084
01:28:15.894 --> 01:28:18.564
- I got to be somewhere.
- Yeah, and we know where.

1085
01:28:19.315 --> 01:28:22.398
You know, I told Bo,
that we should bust you up...

1086
01:28:22.423 --> 01:28:24.953
..and leave you there when we're through.
But he's got a code.

1087
01:28:24.978 --> 01:28:27.370
2 hours and comfortable living, Dyl.

1088
01:28:27.395 --> 01:28:29.612
No, I need to be somewhere.
I'm asking.

1089
01:28:29.637 --> 01:28:31.397
And I'm answering.

1090
01:28:49.535 --> 01:28:52.149
We'll worry about swarms later.
None of your people will ...

1091
01:28:52.168 --> 01:28:54.076
..even know she was here.

1092
01:28:54.101 --> 01:28:56.850
I'm betting she'll be back to normal,
in a..just a couple months.

1093
01:28:57.828 --> 01:28:59.472
Maybe.

1094
01:29:17.783 --> 01:29:19.783
Did you see who was driving that car?

1095
01:29:21.003 --> 01:29:22.227
Go.

1096
01:29:37.200 --> 01:29:39.207
- (Good morning, ladies and gentlemen...)
- Becca.

1097
01:29:39.225 --> 01:29:41.063
(...this is your captain speaking..)

1098
01:29:41.077 --> 01:29:43.077
- (..we are currently creeping up to..)
- Becca.

1099
01:29:46.524 --> 01:29:48.335
Can you hear me?

1100
01:29:49.172 --> 01:29:51.172
Come on, answer me, Rebecca !

1101
01:29:53.290 --> 01:29:54.809
Dylan ?

1102
01:29:56.067 --> 01:29:58.919
Jesus Christ, Rebecca,
what is going on?

1103
01:30:00.851 --> 01:30:02.717
Phillip put me in here.

1104
01:30:04.069 --> 01:30:06.229
I think he thinks
I'm having an affair.

1105
01:30:06.254 --> 01:30:09.667
So he locks you up?
Can he do that ?

1106
01:30:10.066 --> 01:30:11.759
I don't know.

1107
01:30:13.322 --> 01:30:15.148
I'm afraid of him.

1108
01:30:15.173 --> 01:30:17.289
I don't know what he's gonna do.

1109
01:30:18.485 --> 01:30:20.954
Feel like you're under water.
What are they giving you ?

1110
01:30:21.455 --> 01:30:23.455
Phillip gave me these pills.

1111
01:30:23.480 --> 01:30:25.113
I took them.

1112
01:30:25.121 --> 01:30:27.378
He told me to take them
so I took them.

1113
01:30:28.262 --> 01:30:30.262
Do you know where you are ?

1114
01:30:30.287 --> 01:30:31.900
Yeah, in er..

1115
01:30:32.753 --> 01:30:34.753
I think it's the..uhm..

1116
01:30:35.395 --> 01:30:37.261
..Hop Howard clinic.

1117
01:30:37.894 --> 01:30:39.750
It's a mental institution.

1118
01:30:39.775 --> 01:30:42.219
Your husband ought to be
a permanent resident, darliln'.

1119
01:30:44.134 --> 01:30:48.375
- Are you on a plane?
- I'm..I'm headed your way.

1120
01:30:51.462 --> 01:30:54.034
Listen, I need to see the room.

1121
01:30:55.293 --> 01:30:57.902
I want you to look around,
I want to see everything.

1122
01:31:10.209 --> 01:31:11.803
But, is there anything you'll do or...

1123
01:31:11.828 --> 01:31:14.920
I understand, sir, but unfortunately,
we can't arrange a vehicle...

1124
01:31:14.944 --> 01:31:16.788
.. without a valid driver's licence.

1125
01:31:16.814 --> 01:31:19.140
I just don't have it with me right now,
that's all.

1126
01:31:19.165 --> 01:31:22.703
- And I have a really important job
interview. - And I do hope you get that job.

1127
01:31:22.728 --> 01:31:24.762
What I can do,
is arrange a cab for you.

1128
01:31:24.786 --> 01:31:28.809
Perhaps a friend can overnight your licence
while I hold the res... Sir ?

1129
01:31:29.075 --> 01:31:30.440
Thanks.

1130
01:31:57.830 --> 01:32:00.127
- Where are you?
- Still the airport.

1131
01:32:01.823 --> 01:32:03.578
What are you doing?

1132
01:32:04.853 --> 01:32:06.320
Renting.

1133
01:32:19.620 --> 01:32:22.870
Now, twist it to the left.
Slowly.

1134
01:32:24.707 --> 01:32:27.621
Ok, now, see if you can find
the empty space in there.

1135
01:32:28.326 --> 01:32:31.142
Dylan, I can't do this.
I feel like a 4-year-old.

1136
01:32:31.167 --> 01:32:33.210
You can do it.
Just relax.

1137
01:32:33.235 --> 01:32:36.264
Same Fort Knox is just simple locks.

1138
01:32:36.289 --> 01:32:38.796
Oh uhm.. turn here.

1139
01:32:39.867 --> 01:32:42.087
Where did you learn
to do all this stuff anyway ?

1140
01:32:43.657 --> 01:32:45.541
School, mostly.

1141
01:32:45.590 --> 01:32:47.590
I was wondering where you guys
didn't chop.

1142
01:32:47.615 --> 01:32:49.560
Oh I bet you took ballet.

1143
01:32:49.591 --> 01:32:51.640
... or tea appreciation or something.

1144
01:32:56.438 --> 01:32:58.705
- Holy shit, holy shit!
- Hot damn!

1145
01:32:58.730 --> 01:33:00.730
That took me a week to learn that.

1146
01:33:00.754 --> 01:33:04.959
- You're a natural born criminal.
- I bet you say that to all the girls.

1147
01:33:06.975 --> 01:33:08.975
- Am I close ?
- Yeah, I think so.

1148
01:33:09.000 --> 01:33:10.753
Just keep going all the way through town.

1149
01:33:10.766 --> 01:33:12.766
It's right by the train tracks,
you can't miss it.

1150
01:33:12.783 --> 01:33:15.417
Ok, I'll find it.
Time to get a move on now.

1151
01:33:15.442 --> 01:33:17.442
Er.. anybody in the hall ?

1152
01:33:19.420 --> 01:33:21.024
One sec..

1153
01:33:22.251 --> 01:33:24.837
Wait 'till she leaves the hall.

1154
01:33:27.760 --> 01:33:29.583
Check.

1155
01:33:29.608 --> 01:33:31.879
- Nervous ?
- Check.

1156
01:33:32.661 --> 01:33:35.617
Listen, when you get outta there, uhm..

1157
01:33:35.642 --> 01:33:37.642
.. you ever seen Canada?

1158
01:33:38.674 --> 01:33:40.411
Why, what do you have in mind?

1159
01:33:40.436 --> 01:33:44.528
I thought maybe you'd like to have
a romance in an exotic city.

1160
01:33:49.888 --> 01:33:52.236
Go for it.
Just walk like you know where you're going.

1161
01:34:42.548 --> 01:34:44.329
Do you have any idea
where I am?

1162
01:34:49.987 --> 01:34:51.916
No, get back on main street.

1163
01:34:56.552 --> 01:34:58.098
Not a good idea.

1164
01:35:00.067 --> 01:35:03.903
- Shit ! - Turn off the engines
and show me your hands!

1165
01:35:05.342 --> 01:35:07.342
(How are you doing today?)

1166
01:35:14.595 --> 01:35:16.305
Here goes nothing.

1167
01:35:18.962 --> 01:35:21.803
Stop the car !!
I said stop !

1168
01:36:44.165 --> 01:36:46.610
God!
Oh my god !

1169
01:36:48.735 --> 01:36:50.250
Oh my god !

1170
01:36:51.485 --> 01:36:54.982
- Dylan, I can't talk to him! I can't !
- Becky, calm down. You can do this.

1171
01:36:55.654 --> 01:36:57.654
Ok. Ok.

1172
01:36:58.546 --> 01:37:01.197
I'm just gonna walk past him
and it's gonna be totally fine.

1173
01:37:05.238 --> 01:37:07.559
- Rebecca? What are you doing?
- ♥

1174
01:37:09.693 --> 01:37:12.727
- Told you I couldn't talk to him.
- Go,Becky,  just go!

1175
01:37:13.493 --> 01:37:15.493
- (call security)
- Rebecca !

1176
01:37:25.675 --> 01:37:27.112
He's gone.

1177
01:37:39.853 --> 01:37:42.400
The woods.
